        <item>
            <title>5.115</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:28:21 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>701</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>5.115</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.115</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">Layouts</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Four templates.</b> Standard, Gallery, Focus and Dual. Dual opens the gallery on your second screen.</li>
<li><b>Opens as you left it.</b> The app starts in Standard the first time, then always in the layout you chose last, dual screen included.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:8px 0 4px">Paul</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Introduces himself once.</b> After that a new chat starts with a short hello and a question.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:8px 0 4px">3D Composer</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Only scenes that work.</b> The templates Street and Dialogue fill with the bundled people, and in Dialogue they now face each other.</li>
<li><b>Honest about cars.</b> 3D Paul no longer seats people in the bundled cars, which have no interior. He offers the car driving on its own or the person walking to it.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:8px 0 4px">Fixes</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>OmniHuman V2</b> shows its price once an audio track is added, for the track's length, instead of the maximum. FLUX Video Edit waits for its source video the same way.</li>
<li><b>Trimming</b> to the end of a clip works again when its audio ends before the picture.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
